BaseValidationLib::validateMandate
├── given no mandate checks enabled
│   └── it should read pre-computed mandateHash from calldata
├── given hasAnyTargetCheck is true
│   ├── given target validation passes
│   │   └── it should continue to validate other fields
│   └── given target validation fails
│       └── it should return valid = false
├── given hasAnyTargetCheck is false
│   └── it should read pre-computed targetHash and targetChainId from calldata
├── given ORIGIN_OPS is enabled
│   ├── given originOps validation passes
│   │   └── it should include originOpsHash in mandateHash
│   └── given originOps validation fails
│       └── it should return valid = false
├── given ORIGIN_OPS is not enabled
│   └── it should read pre-computed originOpsHash from calldata
├── given DEST_OPS is enabled
│   ├── given destOps validation passes
│   │   └── it should include destOpsHash in mandateHash
│   └── given destOps validation fails
│       └── it should return valid = false
├── given DEST_OPS is not enabled
│   └── it should read pre-computed destOpsHash from calldata
├── given QUALIFICATION is enabled
│   ├── given qualification validation passes
│   │   └── it should include qualificationHash in mandateHash
│   └── given qualification validation fails
│       └── it should return valid = false
├── given QUALIFICATION is not enabled
│   └── it should read pre-computed qualificationHash from calldata
├── given all fields enabled and passing
│   └── it should compute correct mandateHash
└── it should always read minGas from calldata for hash computation